attribution: Words and music by George M. Cohan (died 1942), written for his musical "George Washington, Jr." and published by F. A. Mills, New York, in 1906; this is Cohan's own final wording of the chorus. Public domain: published before 1931 (United States) and all authors died before 1972 (Canada).
